# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal working material — removed from history 2026-09-10 before the
# repository was made public, and ignored so it cannot be re-added.
#   - peer-review correspondence is confidential to the journal and reviewers
#   - narrative/story planning documents are internal author material
#   - agent session logs and local settings are machine-specific
